#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Linkr Bee LAN bridge for the V851S (A7 side).

Wires the Linkr Bee web terminal to the E907's UART3 over rpmsg:

    browser --ws://<board>/ws--> this daemon --rpmsg--> E907 --> UART3

The daemon implements the Linkr Bee LAN protocol (see radxa/linkr-bee
src/ws_bridge.c and src/serial_session.c):

  * GET /ws        WebSocket upgrade, binary frames = serial bytes,
                   text frames = "@control ..." session commands
  * everything else is served from the web/ directory of linkr-bee

Only the Python standard library is used (the board has Python 3.9).
"""

